      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/strandquist_minnesota",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Winter in Strandquist brings about 47 inches of snowfall each year, shaping the local climate and spring melt.",
